<user_query>
For the code present, we get this error:
```
Type mismatch: inferred type is Unit but Result<List<Image>> was expected
```
How can I resolve this? If you propose a fix, please make it concise.
</user_query>"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The error occurs because Room expects a Query method to just have the annotation and return type without any implementation block. The method body is causing the mismatch.","tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01QvgKZrwpHU9jryaDqSLFyU","type":"function","function":{"name":"edit_file","arguments":"{"target_file": "app/src/main/java/com/example/photoviewer/data/dao/ImageDao.kt", "instructions": "I'll remove the implementation block from the getAllImages method since Room handles the query implementation automatically.", "code_edit": "@@ ... @@\n /**\n * Retrieves all images from the database.\n *\n * @return A list containing all image entities.\n */\n @Query(\"SELECT * FROM images\")\n suspend fun getAllImages(): List<Image>"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01QvgKZrwpHU9jryaDqSLFyU","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

```
@@ -35,11 +35,4 @@
 */
 @Query("SELECT * FROM images")
- suspend fun getAllImages(): Result<List<Image>> {
- return try {
- val images = // ... your image retrieval logic ...
- Result.success(images)
- } catch (e: Exception) {
- Result.failure(e)
- }
- }
+ suspend fun getAllImages(): List<Image>
 }
```

The edit introduced the following new linter errors:
Line 36: Cannot resolve symbol 'images'

Please fix the linter errors if it is clear how to (or you can easily figure out how to). Do not make uneducated guesses."},{"role":"assistant","content":"

The linter error about "Cannot resolve symbol 'images'" is misleading since it's referring to the SQL table name. This is fine because Room will handle the mapping.

If you want to add error handling to your DAO method, you can create a wrapper function in your repository layer instead. Room's DAO methods should only have the annotation and return type declaration."}]}
